## Example environment variables for local builds
# Copy to .env and fill values as needed. Do NOT commit .env (it's in .gitignore).

# Optional: explicit Java home used by Gradle (preferred)
# ORG_GRADLE_JAVA_HOME=/path/to/jdk

# Optional fallback: sets JAVA_HOME (will be used if ORG_GRADLE_JAVA_HOME is empty)
# JAVA_HOME=/path/to/jdk
